WEBVTT

00:03:29.327 --> 00:03:32.327
But I did much more than that.

00:03:32.327 --> 00:03:35.009
I put photography as my life.

00:03:35.009 --> 00:03:37.613
I lived totally inside photography

00:03:37.613 --> 00:03:39.648
doing long term projects,

00:03:39.648 --> 00:03:42.158
and I want to show you just a few pictures

00:03:42.158 --> 00:03:48.055
of -- again, you'll see inside the social projects,

00:03:48.055 --> 00:03:50.217
that I went to, I published many books

00:03:50.217 --> 00:03:53.423
on these photographs,

00:03:53.423 --> 00:03:57.178
but I'll just show you a few ones now.